# Trading Pipeline Rules

Preserve Data -> Indicators / SMC / market context -> Model ensemble -> Strategy -> Trade plan -> Risk -> Execution control -> Storage / optional execution.

- Do not bypass downstream validation or execute directly from model output.
- Preserve deterministic safe model fallback.
- Keep timestamps timezone-aware and prevent look-ahead bias.
- Keep model votes, strategy decisions, trade levels, and risk decisions auditable.
- Add regression tests for changed signal behavior.
